<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
 <meta charset="UTF-8">
 <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
 <title>Partner with ONBOARD3</title>
 <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
 <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.7.2/css/all.min.css">
 <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/dashboard.css">
 <style>
 .partner-wrap {
 max-width: 860px;
 margin: 0 auto;
 padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
 }
 .partner-header {
 text-align: center;
 margin-bottom: 3rem;
 }
 .partner-header h1 {
 font-size: 2.25rem;
 font-weight: 900;
 color: #39FF14;
 margin-bottom: .75rem;
 }
 .partner-header p {
 color: var(--text-3);
 font-size: 1.05rem;
 max-width: 520px;
 margin: 0 auto;
 line-height: 1.6;
 }
 .partner-cards {
 display: grid;
 grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
 gap: 1.5rem;
 }
 @media (max-width: 640px) {
 .partner-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
 .partner-header h1 { font-size: 1.7rem; }
 }
 .partner-card {
 background: var(--bg-card);
 border: 2px solid var(--border);
 border-radius: 20px;
 padding: 2rem 1.75rem;
 display: flex;
 flex-direction: column;
 gap: 1.25rem;
 transition: border-color .2s, transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;
 text-decoration: none;
 color: inherit;
 }
 .partner-card:hover {
 transform: translateY(-4px);
 }
 .partner-card--biz {
 border-color: rgba(94,194,19,.25);
 }
 .partner-card--biz:hover {
 border-color: #39FF14;
 box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(94,194,19,.18);
 }
 .partner-card--bd {
 border-color: rgba(168,85,247,.25);
 }
 .partner-card--bd:hover {
 border-color: #a855f7;
 box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(168,85,247,.18);
 }
 .pc-icon {
 width: 60px;
 height: 60px;
 border-radius: 16px;
 display: flex;
 align-items: center;
 justify-content: center;
 font-size: 1.5rem;
 }
 .pc-icon--biz { background: rgba(94,194,19,.12); color: #39FF14; border: 1px solid rgba(94,194,19,.25); }
 .pc-icon--bd { background: rgba(168,85,247,.12); color: #a855f7; border: 1px solid rgba(168,85,247,.25); }
 .pc-title {
 font-size: 1.3rem;
 font-weight: 800;
 color: var(--text);
 margin-bottom: .3rem;
 }
 .pc-desc {
 font-size: .9rem;
 color: var(--text-3);
 line-height: 1.6;
 }
 .pc-perks {
 list-style: none;
 padding: 0;
 margin: 0;
 display: flex;
 flex-direction: column;
 gap: .45rem;
 }
 .pc-perks li {
 font-size: .84rem;
 color: var(--text-2);
 display: flex;
 align-items: center;
 gap: .5rem;
 }
 .pc-perks li i {
 font-size: .65rem;
 flex-shrink: 0;
 }
 .pc-perks--biz li i { color: #39FF14; }
 .pc-perks--bd li i { color: #a855f7; }
 .pc-btn {
 display: flex;
 align-items: center;
 justify-content: center;
 gap: .5rem;
 padding: .875rem 1.5rem;
 border-radius: 12px;
 font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
 font-size: .95rem;
 font-weight: 700;
 cursor: pointer;
 text-decoration: none;
 margin-top: auto;
 transition: opacity .2s, transform .2s;
 }
 .pc-btn:hover { opacity: .9; transform: translateY(-1px); }
 .pc-btn--biz { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #39FF14, #5ec213); color: #000; }
 .pc-btn--bd { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a855f7, #7c3aed); color: #fff; }
 .partner-note {
 text-align: center;
 margin-top: 2.5rem;
 padding: 1.25rem;
 border-radius: 14px;
 background: rgba(255,193,7,.05);
 border: 1px solid rgba(255,193,7,.2);
 color: var(--text-3);
 font-size: .85rem;
 line-height: 1.6;
 }
 .partner-note strong { color: #FFC107; }
 </style>
</head>
<body>
 <% const currentPage = 'partnership'; %>
 <%- include('../partials/sidebar', { user, currentPage }) %>

 <div class="dashboard-container">
 <main class="main-content">
 <div class="partner-wrap">

 <div class="partner-header">
 <h1><i class="fas fa-handshake"></i> Partner with ONBOARD3</h1>
 <p>Choose the role that fits you. Both paths give you access to ONBOARD3's active Web3 community of builders, creators, and developers.</p>
 </div>

 <div class="partner-cards">

 <!-- Business -->
 <div class="partner-card partner-card--biz" style="cursor:default">
 <div class="pc-icon pc-icon--biz">
 <i class="fas fa-building"></i>
 </div>
 <div>
 <div class="pc-title">I'm a Business / Project</div>
 <div class="pc-desc">You represent a project, brand, or DAO that wants to run quests, bounties, and campaigns on ONBOARD3.</div>
 </div>
 <ul class="pc-perks pc-perks--biz">
 <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Host sponsored quests with USDC rewards</li>
 <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Run bounties and creative campaigns</li>
 <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Full entries dashboard and analytics</li>
 <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Direct access to Web3 builders</li>
 <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> FCFS, Competition &amp; Referral quest types</li>
 </ul>
 <a href="/business/signup" class="pc-btn pc-btn--biz">
 <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i> Apply as a Business
 </a>
 </div>

 <!-- Business Developer -->
 <div class="partner-card partner-card--bd" style="cursor:default">
 <div class="pc-icon pc-icon--bd">
 <i class="fas fa-handshake-angle"></i>
 </div>
 <div>
 <div class="pc-title">I'm a Business Developer</div>
 <div class="pc-desc">You bring Web3 projects to ONBOARD3 and earn commission on every partnership you secure.</div>
 </div>
 <ul class="pc-perks pc-perks--bd">
 <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> 40% commission on approved partnerships</li>
 <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Dedicated BD dashboard and tracking</li>
 <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Private BD Telegram group access</li>
 <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Bring quest sponsors, event sponsors &amp; more</li>
 <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Level up through BD tiers (Bronze → Platinum)</li>
 </ul>
 <a href="/business-developers/signup" class="pc-btn pc-btn--bd">
 <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i> Apply as a BD
 </a>
 </div>

 </div>

 <div class="partner-note">
 <strong><i class="fas fa-clock"></i> Admin Review</strong> — Both paths require admin approval before you can log in. Applications are typically reviewed within 24-48 hours. You'll be able to sign in at <a href="/business/login" style="color:#FFC107">/business</a> or <a href="/business-developers/login" style="color:#FFC107">/business-developers</a> once approved.
 </div>

 </div>
 </main>
 </div>
<%- include('../partials/whatsapp-float') %>
</body>
</html>
